                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ddefcfaa-666f-36c1-adda-8ec4a1de4f2e",
                                        "entry_id": "2a64cb99-ee0b-30f6-8982-39efca1dec40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A weight training implement consisting of a short bar with weight counterpoised on each end."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa037177-b9bf-4b28-9df5-be0057de0f21",
                                                "sense_id": "ddefcfaa-666f-36c1-adda-8ec4a1de4f2e",
                                                "text": "He was exercising with the dumbbells in gym class today."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7328ae5-500b-49c8-be88-ad0080fe36b8",
                                                "sense_id": "ddefcfaa-666f-36c1-adda-8ec4a1de4f2e",
                                                "text": "He also had a room strewn with the toys of the trade and what-have-you: ropes and ironmongery, buoyancy aid and bagpipes, fetid socks and half-eaten haggises, dumbbells and ski-instructor sweaters."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f33b6a1e-8797-4680-a740-e11a1fe619b9",
                                                "sense_id": "ddefcfaa-666f-36c1-adda-8ec4a1de4f2e",
                                                "text": "On the map Gansu is shaped like a dumbbell lying obliquely from east to west. Its best known city is Lanjhou, the capital, and also the gateway to the Silk Road. But we did not go there; we were heading for a relatively unknown city a few hundred miles away from Lanjhou, called Tianshuei."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87f859be-c4be-36b0-aea5-f0428c1d6059",
                                        "entry_id": "2a64cb99-ee0b-30f6-8982-39efca1dec40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bell with no clapper, used as bell-striking practice or to strike as a form of physical exercise"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35340871-c8c0-3da6-8f61-52ace56c5ae6",
                                        "entry_id": "2a64cb99-ee0b-30f6-8982-39efca1dec40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A stupid person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dce2d866-b82b-469f-84a2-0d9a674d11f6",
                                                "sense_id": "35340871-c8c0-3da6-8f61-52ace56c5ae6",
                                                "text": "That's fool's gold, you dumbbell. Iron pyrite. Nobody would give you a dime for a ton of it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
